   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Intro (Fool for the City)**: rare: 14 archived performances [4]\n- **Hebrews 11:40**: rare: 13 archived performances [4]\n- **Black Molly**: back after 52 archived shows (586 days) [4]\n- **Happt Birthday to You (for Matt Douglas)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Jazz No Children**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2023-04-18.CM4** (recommended): source not stated; 28 songs; 123 min; rated 2.5/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- John, a Grateful Dead fan, dubbed three songs 'The Goths Suite' [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2023-04-18.CM4**: taped by Tapir Jon; transferred by Tapir Jon; source: Line Audio CM4s > Tascam DR-40 > SD Card [1]. Also: Taped and transferred by Tapir Jon at the DFC in front of SBD [1]",
